# Paradox Gardens, a green-blue surveil land: it enters tapped (so nothing is offered on turn 1), taps for {G} on turn 3 and for {U} on
# turn 5 and offers no {R}. On turn 7 its "{2}{G}{U}, {T}: Surveil 1." is refused with three Moxen that make neither {G} nor {U}, with
